{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le01ob07re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn9le01ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: As luck would have it, we got the tarp up just in time for it to rain!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks for helping. Now we can sit back and enjoy some hot chocolate!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Do you hear that?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, that scratching sound? It's nothing. The tree outside is scraping against the house in the wind.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It sounds like it's coming from inside the house. Wait! Shhhh! Listen.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What? You're freaking me out Peter! Tell me ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I hate to say it, but I think you've got a family of squirrels who are residing up there. They have torn into the roof. Squirrels do a lot of damage. It will need to be dealt with soon. Pest control can take care of it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Do you really think pest control needs to be called? What if we just let the squirrels come out on their own?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No. Squirrels have front teeth that keep growing and they need to be kept short and sharp. They will just keep gnawing at the roof so the problem will only get worse. If you don't get pest control to come soon, that hole will get bigger and you'll need to pay an even crazier  amount of money to have the roof fixed.", "id": 2, "time": "26000"}, {"image": "engenn9le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So many things need fixing! What a catastrophe!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You are being a bit dramatic.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Am I? I am being dramatic? You'll need to be prepared.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What? Why?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Vanessa and I will be staying with you while all this construction is going on.", "id": 3, "time": "70000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about household problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about things that I'm doing and things that are happening.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about things that need to be done.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What type of animals or insects invade houses in your country? What problems do they cause?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What would you do if a family of animals moved into your house?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Something is living in the roof!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Sally and Peter discover squirrels!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "i